{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“Ricci 形式”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Ricci形式"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Kähler流形","text":"Kähler 流形"}},{"Plain":"上的 Ricci 形式为\n$$\r\n\\frac{\\sqrt{-1}}{2\\pi}R_{i\\bar j} dz^i \\wedge d\\bar z^{j}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n"}]}}